LS.add({"2f493f5679":{"t":"02 基督再來 Christ will come again in glory, bodily and visibly","b":3,"k":"unit","h":"<nav class=\"cr\" style=\"--c:#b03a2e\"><a href=\"index.html\">燈臺 <i lang=\"en\">The Lampstand</i></a> <span class=\"sep\">›</span> <a class=\"fl0\" href=\"#ic38303dbb5\">3 聖經真理 Bible Truths</a> <span class=\"sep\">›</span> <a class=\"fl1\" href=\"#i4640b6fad5\">Lessons 課程</a></nav><h1 class=\"fl2\" id=\"第二課--基督再來-christ-will-come-again-in-glory-bodily-and-visibly\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第二課 · 基督再來</span> Christ will come again in glory, bodily and visibly</h1><details class=\"toc\"><summary>目錄 <i lang=\"en\">Contents</i></summary><ol><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\">摘要 Summary</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#1-%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%86-the-truth\">1. 真理 The truth</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#2-%E8%B2%AB%E7%A9%BF%E5%85%A8%E6%9C%AC%E8%81%96%E7%B6%93-through-the-whole-bible\">2. 貫穿全本聖經 Through the whole Bible</a></li><li class=\"l3\"><a href=\"#2a-%E6%87%89%E8%A8%B1-the-promises\">2a. 應許 The promises</a></li><li class=\"l3\"><a href=\"#2b-%E7%B4%84-the-covenant\">2b. 約 The covenant</a></li><li class=\"l3\"><a href=\"#2c-%E9%A0%90%E8%A1%A8-the-types\">2c. 預表 The types</a></li><li class=\"l3\"><a href=\"#2d-%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B-the-stories\">2d. 故事 The stories</a></li><li class=\"l3\"><a href=\"#2e-%E5%9C%A8%E5%9F%BA%E7%9D%A3%E8%A3%8F%E6%88%90%E5%85%A8-fulfilled-in-christ\">2e. 在基督裏成全 Fulfilled in Christ</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#3-%E5%8E%9F%E6%96%87-the-words-beneath-it\">3. 原文 The words beneath it</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#4-%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0-what-all-confess\">4. 共同的信仰 What all confess</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#5-%E7%82%BA%E4%BD%95%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81-why-it-matters\">5. 為何重要 Why it matters</a></li><li class=\"l3\"><a href=\"#5a-%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E5%AE%9A%E6%97%A5%E5%AD%90-no-date-setting\">5a. 不可定日子 No date-setting</a></li><li class=\"l3\"><a href=\"#5b-%E5%B8%B8%E8%81%BD%E5%88%B0%E7%9A%84%E7%96%91%E5%95%8F-questions-people-ask\">5b. 常聽到的疑問 Questions people ask</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#6-%E5%AF%A6%E8%B8%90-in-practice\">6. 實踐 In practice</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#7-%E9%80%A3%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%80%E8%B5%B7-connected\">7. 連在一起 Connected</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#8-%E6%87%89%E7%94%A8%E8%88%87%E8%AC%9B%E9%81%93-for-us-and-for-the-preacher\">8. 應用與講道 For us, and for the preacher</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#9-%E8%A4%87%E7%BF%92-five-review-questions\">9. 複習 Five review questions</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#10-%E9%80%A3%E7%B5%90%E8%88%87%E5%87%BA%E8%99%95-links-and-sources\">10. 連結與出處 Links and sources</a></li><li class=\"l2\"><a href=\"#tag-words-%E6%A8%99%E7%B1%A4%E8%A9%9E\">Tag words 標籤詞</a></li></ol></details>\n<p><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">聖經真理</span></span> · <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">信經與信條</span></span> · <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">上一課：</span><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i969a855a0f\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 1 課 身體復活</span></a> · <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">下一課：</span><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i9a03ac51dc\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 3 課 一次獻上</span></a></p>\n\n<h2 id=\"摘要-summary\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">摘要</span> Summary</h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">一句話：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">那位復活、升天的耶穌，要親自、帶着身體、眾目可見地從天上再來，在榮耀中審判活人死人，叫死人復活，使祂的國完全來到。日子沒有人知道，所以我們儆醒等候。</span><br><em>In one line: the same Jesus who rose and ascended will come again from heaven, personally, bodily and visibly, in glory, to judge the living and the dead, to raise the dead and to bring his kingdom in full. No one knows the day, so we watch and wait.</em></p>\n<div class=\"tw\"><table><thead><tr><th><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">一頁看全課</span></th><th>At a glance</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#1-%E7%9C%9F%E7%90%86-the-truth\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">真理</span></strong> The truth</a></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">同一位耶穌，親自、帶着身體、看得見地再來（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.1.11\">徒 1:11</span>）。</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#2-%E8%B2%AB%E7%A9%BF%E5%85%A8%E6%9C%AC%E8%81%96%E7%B6%93-through-the-whole-bible\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">全本聖經</span></strong> The Bible</a></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">從以諾（猶 14）到聖經最後的禱告（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.22.20\">啟 22:20</span>）；先知看見兩次來臨（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Pet.1.11\">彼前 1:11</span>）。</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#3-%E5%8E%9F%E6%96%87-the-words-beneath-it\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">原文</span></strong> The words</a></td><td><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">παρουσία</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἐπιφάνεια</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἀποκάλυψις</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Dan.7.13\">但 7:13</span> 的亞蘭文；</span><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">יֹום־יְהוָה</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「耶和華的日子」。</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#4-%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0-what-all-confess\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">信經</span></strong> The creeds</a></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">各傳統同認「將在榮耀中再來」；分歧只在前後的次序（千禧年、被提）。</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#5-%E7%82%BA%E4%BD%95%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81-why-it-matters\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">為何重要</span></strong> Why</a></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">福音的結局；延遲是憐憫（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Pet.3.9\">彼後 3:9</span>）；不可定日子。</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#6-%E5%AF%A6%E8%B8%90-in-practice\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">實踐</span></strong> In practice</a></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">儆醒、作工、聖潔、忍耐、安慰、傳揚、禱告「主耶穌啊，我願你來」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.22.20\">Rev 22:20</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#7-%E9%80%A3%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%80%E8%B5%B7-connected\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">連在一起</span></strong> Connected</a></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">原文研究、啟示錄與希伯來書、末日時鐘、聖詩。</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#8-%E6%87%89%E7%94%A8%E8%88%87%E8%AC%9B%E9%81%93-for-us-and-for-the-preacher\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">講道</span></strong> To preach it</a></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.1.9-11\">徒 1:9-11</span>：同一位、同樣地、不要呆望。</span></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#9-%E8%A4%87%E7%BF%92-five-review-questions\"><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">複習</span></strong> Review</a></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">五題，附答案與經文。</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<blockquote class=\"verse\"><div class=\"zh\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「加利利人哪，你們為甚麼站着望天呢？這離開你們被接升天的耶穌，你們見他怎樣往天上去，他還要怎樣來。」（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.1.11\">使徒行傳 1:11</span>）</span></div><div class=\"en\">who also said, Ye men of Galilee, why stand ye looking into heaven? this Jesus, who was received up from you into heaven, shall so come in like manner as ye beheld him going into heaven. (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.1.11\">Acts 1:11</span>, ASV)</div></blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"1-真理-the-truth\">1. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">真理</span> The truth <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">耶穌要再來：就是那位被釘、復活、升天的耶穌，親自、帶着身體、眾目可見地從天上降臨，在榮耀中審判活人死人；那時死人要復活，祂的國要完全來到。</span></strong><br><em>Jesus will come again: the very Jesus who was crucified, rose and ascended will descend from heaven personally, bodily and visibly, in glory, to judge the living and the dead; then the dead will rise and his kingdom will come in full.</em></p>\n<blockquote class=\"verse\"><div class=\"zh\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">像這樣，基督既然一次被獻，擔當了多人的罪，將來要向那等候他的人第二次顯現，並與罪無關，乃是為拯救他們。（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.9.28\">希伯來書 9:28</span>）</span></div><div class=\"en\">so Christ also, having been once offered to bear the sins of many, shall appear a second time, apart from sin, to them that wait for him, unto salvation. (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.9.28\">Hebrews 9:28</span>, ASV)</div></blockquote>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">四個字概括新約的教導：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">親自</span> personally<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「主必親自從天降臨」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Thess.4.16\">1 Thess 4:16</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）（不是差派別人，也不只是聖靈的同在）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">身體</span> bodily<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「這離開你們被接升天的耶穌」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.1.11\">Acts 1:11</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），就是給門徒看手腳的那一位（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.24.39\">路 24:39</span>，第 1 課）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">可見</span> visibly<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「眾目要看見他」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.1.7\">Rev 1:7</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；「閃電從東邊發出，直照到西邊」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.24.27\">Matt 24:27</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">在榮耀中</span> in glory<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「當人子在他榮耀裏，同着眾天使降臨的時候」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.25.31\">Matt 25:31</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"2-貫穿全本聖經-through-the-whole-bible\">2. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">貫穿全本聖經</span> Through the whole Bible <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<p><img class=\"emb\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"charts/L02 the promise of his coming 再來的應許.svg\" src=\"pages/d6a5d6a766.svg\"><br><em><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">一張圖看全本聖經：左邊是舊約的應許，右邊是新約引用或呼應它的經文；綠線已在第一次來應驗，橙線仍在等候。</span></em></p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">聖經講兩次來臨：第一次「基督受苦難」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Pet.1.11\">1 Pet 1:11</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），第二次「後來得榮耀」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Pet.1.11\">1 Pet 1:11</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。先知常把兩座山峰看成一座，中間隔着的山谷就是今天的教會時代：見拉金的</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">〈預言的山峰〉</span>Mountain Peaks of Prophecy</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"2a-應許-the-promises\">2a. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">應許</span> The promises</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">以諾</span> Enoch</strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（</span><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">חֲנוֹךְ</span></span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">Ἑνὼχ</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）：「看哪，主帶着他的千萬聖者降臨」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Jude.1.14\">Jude 1:14</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。說話的人活在創世記第五章（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Gen.5.21-24\">創 5:21-24</span>），聖經記下的人類早期的預言，已經是主的降臨。（猶大引的這句話也見於《以諾一書》1:9，那卷書不在正典之內。）</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">詩篇：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「因為他來了，他來要審判全地」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Ps.96.13\">Ps 96:13</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。希伯來文</span> <span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">כִּי בָא כִּי בָא</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，直譯</span> <em>for he comes, for he comes</em><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，連說兩次（又見<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Ps.98.9\">詩 98:9</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">但以理</span> Daniel</strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（</span><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">דָּנִיֵּאל</span></span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">Δανιὴλ</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）：「見有一位像人子的，駕着天雲而來」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Dan.7.13\">Dan 7:13</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），而且「他的國必不敗壞」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Dan.7.14\">Dan 7:14</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">撒迦利亞</span> Zechariah</strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（</span><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">זְכַרְיָה</span></span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">Ζαχαρίας</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）：「那日，他的腳必站在耶路撒冷前面朝東的橄欖山上」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Zech.14.4\">Zech 14:4</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；「耶和華我的神必降臨，有一切聖者同來」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Zech.14.5\">Zech 14:5</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">耶穌自己：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「就必再來接你們到我那裏去」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.14.3\">John 14:3</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。在大祭司面前他引但以理書：「後來你們要看見人子坐在那權能者的右邊，駕着天上的雲降臨」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.26.64\">Matt 26:64</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），大祭司就說「他說了僭妄的話」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.26.65\">Matt 26:65</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">天使與使徒：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.1.11\">徒 1:11</span>（本課鑰節）；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Thess.4.16-17\">帖前 4:16-17</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.9.28\">來 9:28</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Jas.5.8\">雅 5:8</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Pet.3.10\">彼後 3:10</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1John.3.2\">約壹 3:2</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.22.20\">啟 22:20</span>。</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"2b-約-the-covenant\">2b. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">約</span> The covenant</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">亞伯拉罕：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">神應許他「必得承受世界」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rom.4.13\">Rom 4:13</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），可是「這些人都是存着信心死的，並沒有得着所應許的」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.11.13\">Heb 11:13</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。他們等候的城（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.11.10\">來 11:10</span>, <span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.11.16\">16</span>），要在主來以後從天降下（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.21.2\">啟 21:2</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">大衛：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「你的國位也必堅定，直到永遠」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Sam.7.16\">2 Sam 7:16</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。天使對馬利亞說：「他的國也沒有窮盡」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.1.33\">Luke 1:33</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），正是尼西亞信經「他的國度永無窮盡」的出處（第 4 段）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">新約：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">主的晚餐是新約的筵席，一面回頭看十字架，一面向前看他來：「是表明主的死，直等到他來」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.11.26\">1 Cor 11:26</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。主自己說：「直到我在我父的國裏同你們喝新的那日子」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.26.29\">Matt 26:29</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。每一次擘餅，都是一個「直等到」。</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"2c-預表-the-types\">2c. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">預表</span> The types</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">大祭司出來祝福：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">贖罪日大祭司進聖所，「直等到他為自己和本家並以色列全會眾贖了罪出來」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Lev.16.17\">Lev 16:17</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；百姓在外面等（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.1.21\">路 1:21</span>）。摩西、亞倫「又出來為百姓祝福，耶和華的榮光就向眾民顯現」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Lev.9.23\">Lev 9:23</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。希伯來書 9 章用三個「顯現」說同一位大祭司：已經「顯現一次」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.9.26\">Heb 9:26</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）除罪，如今「顯在神面前」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.9.24\">Heb 9:24</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），將來「第二次顯現」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.9.28\">Heb 9:28</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）（第 3 段）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">新郎：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「新郎來了，你們出來迎接他」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.25.6\">Matt 25:6</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。許多解經家把約 14:2-3 讀成婚禮的圖畫：新郎先回父家預備地方，再來迎娶。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">約瑟</span> Joseph</strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（</span><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">יוֹסֵף</span></span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">Ἰωσὴφ</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）</span><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">與摩西</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（有人這樣讀）：司提反講道說，「第二次約瑟與弟兄們相認」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.7.13\">Acts 7:13</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；摩西也是先被棄絕，後被神差來作救贖的（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.7.35\">徒 7:35</span>）。第一次被自己的人拒絕，第二次被認出來。</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"2d-故事-the-stories\">2d. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">故事</span> The stories</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">升天：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「有一朵雲彩把他接去，便看不見他了」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.1.9\">Acts 1:9</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。地點是橄欖山</span> Mount of Olives<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（</span><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">הַר הַזֵּיתִים</span></span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ὄρους τῶν Ἐλαιῶν</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.1.12\">徒 1:12</span>）：撒迦利亞說他的腳要站的那座山（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Zech.14.4\">亞 14:4</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">挪亞</span> Noah</strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（</span><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">נֹחַ</span></span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">Νῶε</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）</span><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">與羅得</span> Lot</strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（</span><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">לוֹט</span></span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">Λὼτ</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）：「挪亞的日子怎樣，人子的日子也要怎樣」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.17.26\">Luke 17:26</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）：人照常吃喝嫁娶，直到那一天（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.17.27-30\">路 17:27-30</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">以諾、以利亞被接去：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「神將他取去」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Gen.5.24\">Gen 5:24</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；以利亞「乘旋風升天去了」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Kgs.2.11\">2 Kgs 2:11</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。主來的時候，「我們這活着還存留的人必和他們一同被提到雲裏」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Thess.4.17\">1 Thess 4:17</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）（有人把前者讀作後者的影兒）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">登山變像：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">彼得說，他們傳「我們主耶穌基督的大能和他降臨的事」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Pet.1.16\">2 Pet 1:16</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），因為「親眼見過他的威榮」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Pet.1.16\">2 Pet 1:16</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。山上那一刻，是他來時榮耀的預演（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.16.28-28,Matt.17.1-2\">太 16:28–17:2</span>）。</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"2e-在基督裏成全-fulfilled-in-christ\">2e. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">在基督裏成全</span> Fulfilled in Christ</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">兩次來，一個動詞：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">撒迦利亞用同一個</span> <span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">בּוֹא</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「來」說兩次來臨：謙和的王「騎着驢」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Zech.9.9\">Zech 9:9</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）來，</span><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">יָבֹוא</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，已經應驗（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.21.5\">太 21:5</span>）；</span><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">וּבָא יְהוָה</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，「耶和華我的神必降臨，有一切聖者同來」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Zech.14.5\">Zech 14:5</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），仍在等候。保羅把後者說成「我們主耶穌同他眾聖徒來的時候」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Thess.3.13\">1 Thess 3:13</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）：先知說「耶和華我的神」的地方，使徒說「我們主耶穌」（見第 4 課）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">是身體，帶着釘痕：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「他們必仰望我〔或作：他；本節同〕，就是他們所扎的」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Zech.12.10\">Zech 12:10</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）</span>→ <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「連刺他的人也要看見他」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.1.7\">Rev 1:7</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。再來的是那復活的身體（第 1 課）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">看得見，不是秘密的：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「看哪，基督在內屋中…你們不要信」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.24.26\">Matt 24:26</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），因為他來要像閃電（24:27）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">審判活人死人：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">信經這句話出自 「將來審判活人死人的基督耶穌」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Tim.4.1\">2 Tim 4:1</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Tim.4.1\">2 Tim 4:1</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；又見<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.10.42\">徒 10:42</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">為拯救他們：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">他第二次顯現「並與罪無關，乃是為拯救他們」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.9.28\">Heb 9:28</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。他要「將我們這卑賤的身體改變形狀，和他自己榮耀的身體相似」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Phil.3.21\">Phil 3:21</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">日子無人知道：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">連子也不說出來（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.24.36\">太 24:36</span>）；「父憑着自己的權柄所定的時候、日期，不是你們可以知道的」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.1.7\">Acts 1:7</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"3-原文-the-words-beneath-it\">3. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">原文</span> The words beneath it <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<div class=\"tw\"><table><thead><tr><th><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">字</span> Word</th><th><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">意思</span> Meaning</th><th><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">新約</span> NT (OpenGNT)</th><th><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">說主再來</span> of his coming (counted by reading each verse)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">παρουσία</span></span> <em>parousía</em></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">來到、在場</span> coming, presence</td><td>24 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">次（24 節）</span></td><td>16<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；另：「神的日子」1（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Pet.3.12\">彼後 3:12</span>）、不法的人 1（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Thess.2.9\">帖後 2:9</span>）、人 6（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.16.17\">林前 16:17</span> …）</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἐπιφάνεια</span></span> <em>epipháneia</em></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">顯現</span> appearing, manifestation</td><td>6 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">次（6 節）</span></td><td>5<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；另 1 次說第一次來（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Tim.1.10\">提後 1:10</span>）</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἀποκάλυψις</span></span> <em>apokálypsis</em></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">揭開、顯現</span> unveiling, revelation</td><td>18 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">次（18 節）</span></td><td>5<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.1.7\">林前 1:7</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Thess.1.7\">帖後 1:7</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Pet.1.7\">彼前 1:7</span>, <span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Pet.1.13\">13</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Pet.4.13\">4:13</span>）</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἔρχομαι</span></span> <em>érchomai</em></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">來</span> come</td><td>632 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">次（595 節）</span></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.1.11\">徒 1:11</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"John.14.3\">約 14:3</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.22.20\">啟 22:20</span> 等</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">בּוֹא</span></span> <em>bôʼ</em></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">來、進入</span> come, enter</td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">舊約 2,576 次（2,308 節，</span>BHSA<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）</span></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">七十士譯本多譯作</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἔρχομαι</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（684 節）或</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἥκω</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（174 節）</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">παρουσία</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，「駕臨」：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">新約時代的日常用語，常指君王或官長的來訪（</span>Deissmann 1910<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；在七十士譯本有希伯來原文的書卷中一次也沒有。門徒在橄欖山上問：</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">τί τὸ σημεῖον τῆς σῆς παρουσίας</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，「你降臨…有甚麼預兆呢」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.24.3\">Matt 24:3</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。四福音只有馬太福音 24 章用這個字（24:3, 27, 37, 39）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἐπιφάνεια</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，一個字說兩次來：</span></strong><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">τῆς ἐπιφανείας τοῦ Σωτῆρος ἡμῶν</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，「我們救主…的顯現」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Tim.1.10\">2 Tim 1:10</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），已經把死廢去；我們還等候</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἐπιφάνειαν τῆς δόξης</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Titus.2.13\">多 2:13</span>）。</span>ASV <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">作</span> \"appearing of the glory\" (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Titus.2.13\">Titus 2:13</span>)<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，</span>KJV <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">作</span> \"the glorious appearing\" (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Titus.2.13\">Titus 2:13</span>, KJV)<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Thess.2.8\">帖後 2:8</span> 把兩個字放在一起：</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">τῇ ἐπιφανείᾳ τῆς παρουσίας αὐτοῦ</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，</span>ASV \"the manifestation of his coming\" (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Thess.2.8\">2 Thess 2:8</span>)<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，和合本作「降臨的榮光」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Thess.2.8\">2 Thess 2:8</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">希伯來書 9 章的三個「顯現」：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">過去，</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">πεφανέρωται</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，「顯現一次」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.9.26\">Heb 9:26</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）除罪；現在，</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἐμφανισθῆναι</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，「顯在神面前」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.9.24\">Heb 9:24</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；將來，</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἐκ δευτέρου</span></span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ὀφθήσεται</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，「第二次顯現」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.9.28\">Heb 9:28</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。新約只有這裏明說「第二次」。等候他的人，</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἀπεκδεχομένοις</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，是伸長脖子盼望的意思（又見<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Phil.3.20\">腓 3:20</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.1.11\">徒 1:11</span> 的三個詞：</span></strong><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">οὗτος ὁ Ἰησοῦς</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，直譯</span> <em>this Jesus</em><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：同一位（</span>KJV \"this same Jesus\" (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.1.11\">Acts 1:11</span>, KJV)<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">οὕτως ἐλεύσεται ὃν τρόπον</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，「怎樣往天上去，他還要怎樣來」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.1.11\">Acts 1:11</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）：同樣的方式；</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἐθεάσασθε</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，「你們見」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.1.11\">Acts 1:11</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）：眼睛看見的。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Dan.7.13\">但 7:13</span>，亞蘭文</span> Aramaic<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：</span></strong><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">עִם־עֲנָנֵי שְׁמַיָּא</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，直譯</span> <em>with the clouds of heaven</em><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；</span><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">כְּבַר אֱנָשׁ</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，</span><em>like a son of man</em><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；</span><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">אָתֵה</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，</span><em>coming</em><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。耶穌最常用的自稱「人子」出自這裏。<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.26.64\">太 26:64</span> 說</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἐρχόμενον ἐπὶ τῶν νεφελῶν</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，</span><em>coming on the clouds</em><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.1.7\">啟 1:7</span> 說</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἔρχεται μετὰ τῶν νεφελῶν</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，</span><em>he comes with the clouds</em><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">μετά</span></span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">正是亞蘭文的</span> <span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">עִם</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；七十士譯本的但以理書（讀起來像狄奧多田譯本）也作</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">μετά των νεφελών</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">哈</span> 2:3 → <span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.10.37\">來 10:37</span>：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">希伯來文</span> <span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">כִּי־בֹא יָבֹא</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，「必然臨到」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Hab.2.3\">Hab 2:3</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），說的是那默示，還說</span> <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#ibd4fbde8cb\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">חַכֵּה</span></a><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，「還要等候」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Hab.2.3\">Hab 2:3</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。七十士譯本作</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ερχόμενος ήξει</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，直譯</span> <em>a coming one will come</em><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，是陽性分詞（「默示」</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ὅρασις</span></span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">卻是陰性）；希伯來書再加上冠詞：</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ὁ ἐρχόμενος ἥξει καὶ οὐ χρονίσει</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，「那要來的就來，並不遲延」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.10.37\">Heb 10:37</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。默示成了一位要來的主。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">Μαράνα θά</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.16.22\">林前 16:22</span>）：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">亞蘭文寫成希臘字母，照</span> NA28 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">的分法，直譯是</span> <em>Our Lord, come!</em><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（另一種分法讀作</span> <em>Our Lord has come</em><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。和合本作「主必要來」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.16.22\">1 Cor 16:22</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），</span>KJV <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">作</span> \"Anathema Maranatha\" (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.16.22\">1 Cor 16:22</span>, KJV)<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.22.20\">啟 22:20</span> 的</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἔρχου Κύριε Ἰησοῦ</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，「主耶穌啊，我願你來」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.22.20\">Rev 22:20</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），是它的希臘文雙胞胎。最早的教會用希伯來人、希臘人都懂的一句話禱告。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「耶和華的日子」：</span></strong><span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">יֹום־יְהוָה</span></span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">這兩個字連在一起，在先知書出現 16 次（14 節：<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Isa.13.6\">賽 13:6</span>, <span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Isa.13.9\">9</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Ezek.13.5\">結 13:5</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Joel.1.15\">珥 1:15</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Joel.2.1\">2:1</span>, <span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Joel.2.11\">11</span>, <span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Joel.2.31\">31</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Joel.3.14\">3:14</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Amos.5.18\">摩 5:18</span> 兩次、20；俄 15；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Zeph.1.7\">番 1:7</span>, 14 兩次；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Mal.4.5\">瑪 4:5</span>；</span>BHSA<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，另有四處只是字面相連：<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Lev.9.4\">利 9:4</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Kgs.2.3\">王下 2:3</span>, <span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Kgs.2.5\">5</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Ezek.48.35\">結 48:35</span>）。新約說「主的日子」（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Thess.5.2\">帖前 5:2</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Pet.3.10\">彼後 3:10</span>），也說「基督的日子」（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Phil.1.10\">腓 1:10</span>）：耶和華的日子，就是耶穌基督的日子。</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"4-共同的信仰-what-all-confess\">4. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">共同的信仰</span> What all confess <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">尼西亞信經（381）：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「將在榮耀中再來，審判活人、死人，他的國度永無窮盡。」（合一中譯本）</span>\"He will come again in glory to judge the living and the dead, and his kingdom will have no end.\" (ELLC 1988)</li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">使徒信經：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「將來必從那裏降臨，審判活人，死人。」</span>\"and he will come to judge the living and the dead.\" (ELLC 1988)</li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">西敏信條 33 章、大要理問答第 56 問</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">也這樣認信；信條還說，主要那日子向人隱藏，好叫人不倚靠肉體的安穩，時時儆醒（大意，33.3）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">不同之處：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">東正教、天主教、更正教都認信主要親自、可見地再來；不同的只是他來前後的次序：啟示錄 20 章的一千年（前千禧年、無千禧年、後千禧年），信徒是否在大災難以前被提。各有忠心的信徒持守，見</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">啟示錄研究 · 難題</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">信經</span> Creeds<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：</span></strong><span class=\"off\">AC 12</span> · <span class=\"off\">NC 23–24</span> · <span class=\"off\">AT 39–40</span> · <span class=\"off\">WCF XXXIII</span> · <span class=\"off\">WLC 51–56</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；全文與各行連結：</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">信經與信條</span> Creeds and confessions</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"5-為何重要-why-it-matters\">5. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">為何重要</span> Why it matters <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">為信仰。</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">復活是初熟的果子，收割在他來的時候：「以後，在他來的時候，是那些屬基督的」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.23\">1 Cor 15:23</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。沒有再來，福音就沒有結局，信經的最後幾行（審判、復活、來世）都懸在半空。譏誚的人問：「主要降臨的應許在那裏呢」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Pet.3.4\">2 Pet 3:4</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；神的回答是：「主看一日如千年」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Pet.3.8\">2 Pet 3:8</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），而且「不願有一人沉淪，乃願人人都悔改」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Pet.3.9\">2 Pet 3:9</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。延遲不是忘記，是憐憫。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">為基督徒的生活。</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">盼望叫人聖潔：「凡向他有這指望的，就潔淨自己，像他潔淨一樣」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1John.3.3\">1 John 3:3</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；叫人忍耐：「你們也當忍耐，堅固你們的心；因為主來的日子近了」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Jas.5.8\">Jas 5:8</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；叫人忠心作工，直到他回來（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.19.13\">路 19:13</span>）；也叫人「愛慕他顯現」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Tim.4.8\">2 Tim 4:8</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">為人的存在。</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">歷史不是循環，也不是隨機漫步，而是走向一個定了的日子：「因為他已經定了日子，要藉着他所設立的人按公義審判天下」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.17.31\">Acts 17:31</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。不公義不會永遠得逞；受造之物要更新（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.21.5\">啟 21:5</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Pet.3.13\">彼後 3:13</span>）；我們的身體要得贖（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Phil.3.21\">腓 3:21</span>）。</span><em><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">從統計的角度看：日子是定了的，只是不在我們的資料裏。</span></em></p>\n<h3 id=\"5a-不可定日子-no-date-setting\">5a. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">不可定日子</span> No date-setting</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"verse\"><div class=\"zh\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「但那日子，那時辰，沒有人知道，連天上的使者也不知道，子也不知道，惟獨父知道。（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.24.36\">馬太福音 24:36</span>）</span></div><div class=\"en\">But of that day and hour knoweth no one, not even the angels of heaven, neither the Son, but the Father only. (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.24.36\">Matthew 24:36</span>, ASV)</div></blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">歷史的教訓：</span></strong>William Miller <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">算出 1843 至 1844 年，1844 年 10 月 22 日成了「大失望」；</span>Edgar Whisenant <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">寫《1988 年被提的 88 個理由》；</span>Harold Camping <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">定在 2011 年 5 月 21 日，再改到 10 月 21 日。每一次都傷了信徒，給了譏誚的人口實（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Pet.3.3-4\">彼後 3:3-4</span>）。一句：看主，不看日曆。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">另一邊的錯：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「我的主人必來得遲」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.24.48\">Matt 24:48</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），是惡僕的心。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">時兆是叫人儆醒，不是叫人推算：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">聽見打仗的風聲，「總不要驚慌…只是末期還沒有到」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.24.6\">Matt 24:6</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；「這天國的福音要傳遍天下，對萬民作見證，然後末期纔來到」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.24.14\">Matt 24:14</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"5b-常聽到的疑問-questions-people-ask\">5b. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">常聽到的疑問</span> Questions people ask</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「已經兩千年了。」</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">一日如千年；他的忍耐是給人悔改的時間（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Pet.3.8-9\">彼後 3:8-9</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「再來是不是只是屬靈的（聖靈降臨、主後 70 年、人死的時候）？」</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「你們見他怎樣往天上去，他還要怎樣來」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.1.11\">Acts 1:11</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；死人復活是在「在他來的時候」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.23\">1 Cor 15:23</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），還沒有發生；說「復活的事已過」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Tim.2.18\">2 Tim 2:18</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）的人被保羅說是「偏離了真道」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Tim.2.18\">2 Tim 2:18</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「有人說基督已經秘密地來了。」</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\"><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.24.23-27\">太 24:23-27</span>：他來要像閃電，人人看見。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「這世代還沒有過去」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.24.34\">Matt 24:34</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">一行中立的話：有人讀作耶路撒冷在主後 70 年被毀（24:4-35 的事），有人把「世代」讀作「這一類人」；到了「但那日子」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.24.36\">Matt 24:36</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），話題轉到他的再來。</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"6-實踐-in-practice\">6. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">實踐</span> In practice <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">儆醒：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「我對你們所說的話，也是對眾人說：要儆醒」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Mark.13.37\">Mark 13:37</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">作工：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「你們去作生意，直等我回來」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.19.13\">Luke 19:13</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；</span>ASV \"Trade ye herewith till I come\" (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.19.13\">Luke 19:13</span>)<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，</span>KJV \"Occupy till I come\" (<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.19.13\">Luke 19:13</span>, KJV)<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">聖潔：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">向他有指望的，就潔淨自己（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1John.3.3\">約壹 3:3</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">忍耐：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">像農夫等候秋雨春雨（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Jas.5.7-8\">雅 5:7-8</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">安慰：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">在喪禮上讀<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Thess.4.13-18\">帖前 4:13-18</span>，然後「所以，你們當用這些話彼此勸慰」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Thess.4.18\">1 Thess 4:18</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">傳揚：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">福音要傳遍天下，然後末期纔來到（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.24.14\">太 24:14</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">禱告：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">每一次擘餅，都說「直等到他來」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.11.26\">1 Cor 11:26</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），也和教會一起禱告：「主耶穌啊，我願你來」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.22.20\">Rev 22:20</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"7-連在一起-connected\">7. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">連在一起</span> Connected <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">原文研究：</span></strong><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#ibd4fbde8cb\">S16 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">指望</span></a><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：錨「通入幔內」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.6.19\">Heb 6:19</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），先鋒耶穌從那裏進去（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.6.20\">來 6:20</span>），也要從那裏「第二次顯現」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.9.28\">Heb 9:28</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）；盼望有一頭拴在他身上。</span><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i1b5f27bacc\">S18 <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">彌賽亞</span></a><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：「人子」是<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Dan.7.13\">但 7:13</span> 的彌賽亞稱號。</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">末世論</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：10.17「顯現」</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἐπιφάνεια</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">書卷研究：</span></strong><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">啟示錄</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：全卷以</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἔρχομαι ταχύ</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，「我必快來」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.22.20\">Rev 22:20</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">），作結；它的四種讀法和千禧年三說都在那裏。</span><a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i7a592efe93\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">希伯來書</span></a> 9:28<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；10:37：大祭司出來的那一天。</span></li>\n\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">世界觀察：</span></strong><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">末日時鐘</span> The Doomsday Clock</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（16 末世）：科學家的鐘量的是恐懼，離「午夜」還有多少；聖經給的是一位要來的人和一個應許，沒有時刻表。一句：世界看鐘而害怕，我們看主而儆醒。</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第三次世界大戰？</span> World War III</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：主的話是「總不要驚慌」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.24.6\">Matt 24:6</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">聖詩：</span></strong><span class=\"off\">Lo! He Comes with Clouds Descending <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">看哪救主駕雲降臨</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（衛斯理查理 1758，<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.1.7\">啟 1:7</span> 的詩；</span>SVCA 157<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）</span>· <span class=\"off\">It Is Well with My Soul <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">哦我魂可無恐</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（</span>SVCA 494<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；末節盼望主降臨）· 韓德爾《彌賽亞》第三部〈號筒要響〉（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.15.52\">林前 15:52</span></span><span class=\"off\"></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">看得見的地方：</span></strong><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">聖地立體地圖</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：橄欖山在耶路撒冷東邊，隔着汲淪谷；聖經圓圖：</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">使徒行傳</span></span> · <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">撒迦利亞書</span></span> · <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">啟示錄</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。</span></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"8-應用與講道-for-us-and-for-the-preacher\">8. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">應用與講道</span> For us, and for the preacher <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">再來不是嚇人的故事，是新娘等新郎：等候他的人，他來是「為拯救他們」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.9.28\">Heb 9:28</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。</span></li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">盼望改變日程：如果他今晚就來，我們最想先作完的事，就是今天該作的事。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">思考：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">你等候主來，比較像儆醒的童女，還是看日曆的人，還是說「我的主人必來得遲」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.24.48\">Matt 24:48</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）的僕人？</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">講道：<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.1.9-11\">徒 1:9-11</span>，三點</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>A <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「這離開你們被接升天的耶穌」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.1.11\">Acts 1:11</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）：同一位。</span></strong><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">οὗτος ὁ Ἰησοῦς</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：就是帶着釘痕復活的那一位（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.24.39\">路 24:39</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Zech.12.10\">亞 12:10</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.1.7\">啟 1:7</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong>B <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「你們見他怎樣往天上去，他還要怎樣來」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.1.11\">Acts 1:11</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）：同樣地。</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">帶着身體、看得見、駕雲、回到橄欖山（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Dan.7.13\">但 7:13</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Zech.14.4\">亞 14:4</span>）。</span></li>\n<li><strong>C <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「你們為甚麼站着望天呢」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.1.11\">Acts 1:11</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）：不要呆望。</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">回耶路撒冷同心禱告（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.1.12-14\">徒 1:12-14</span>），等候聖靈，作他的見證，直到地極（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.1.8\">徒 1:8</span>）。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"9-複習-five-review-questions\">9. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">複習</span> Five review questions <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">「基督再來」有哪四個特點？</span></strong>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">親自（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Thess.4.16\">帖前 4:16</span>）、帶着身體（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.1.11\">徒 1:11</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.24.39\">路 24:39</span>）、眾目可見（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.1.7\">啟 1:7</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.24.27\">太 24:27</span>）、在榮耀中審判活人死人（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.25.31\">太 25:31</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Tim.4.1\">提後 4:1</span>）。</span></p></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">舊約怎樣預告祂的再來？在應許、約、預表、故事中各舉一例。</span></strong>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">應許：<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Dan.7.13-14\">但 7:13-14</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Zech.14.4-5\">亞 14:4-5</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Ps.96.13\">詩 96:13</span>。約：大衛的國沒有窮盡（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Sam.7.16\">撒下 7:16</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.1.33\">路 1:33</span>）；聖餐「直等到他來」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.11.26\">1 Cor 11:26</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）。預表：大祭司出來祝福（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Lev.9.23\">利 9:23</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Heb.9.28\">來 9:28</span>）。故事：挪亞的日子（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.17.26-27\">路 17:26-27</span>）；升天（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.1.9-11\">徒 1:9-11</span>）。</span></p></li>\n<li><strong><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">παρουσία</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἐπιφάνεια</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἀποκάλυψις</span></span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">與<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Dan.7.13\">但 7:13</span> 的亞蘭文告訴我們甚麼？</span></strong>\n<p><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">παρουσία</span></span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">是君王的「駕臨」（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.24.3\">太 24:3</span>, <span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.24.27\">27</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Thess.4.15\">帖前 4:15</span>）；</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἐπιφάνεια</span></span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">同一個字說兩次來（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Tim.1.10\">提後 1:10</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Titus.2.13\">多 2:13</span>）；</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἀποκάλυψις</span></span> <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">是他從天上揭開、顯現（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Thess.1.7\">帖後 1:7</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Pet.1.7\">彼前 1:7</span>）；「像人子的，駕着天雲而來」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Dan.7.13\">Dan 7:13</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）是耶穌自己引用的（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.26.64\">太 26:64</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.1.7\">啟 1:7</span>）。</span></p></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">為甚麼不可以定日子？又為甚麼不可以以為主來得遲？</span></strong>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">日子只有父知道（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.24.36\">太 24:36</span>；<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Acts.1.7\">徒 1:7</span>）；定日子的人一再傷了信徒（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Pet.3.3-4\">彼後 3:3-4</span>）。說「我的主人必來得遲」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.24.48\">Matt 24:48</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）的是惡僕；延遲是神的忍耐（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"2Pet.3.9\">彼後 3:9</span>）。</span></p></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">主再來的盼望怎樣改變今天的生活？</span></strong>\n<p><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">儆醒（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Mark.13.37\">可 13:37</span>）、作工（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Luke.19.13\">路 19:13</span>）、聖潔（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1John.3.2-3\">約壹 3:2-3</span>）、忍耐（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Jas.5.7-8\">雅 5:7-8</span>）、彼此勸慰（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Thess.4.18\">帖前 4:18</span>）、傳福音（<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Matt.24.14\">太 24:14</span>）、禱告「主耶穌啊，我願你來」（</span><span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"Rev.22.20\">Rev 22:20</span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">）（又見<span class=\"ilref\" tabindex=\"0\" data-q=\"1Cor.16.22\">林前 16:22</span>）。</span></p></li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"10-連結與出處-links-and-sources\">10. <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">連結與出處</span> Links and sources <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">範疇：</span></strong><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">末世論</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（10.17 顯現）；</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">基督論</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">（2.05 人子）。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">前後課：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">上一課</span> <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i969a855a0f\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 1 課 身體復活</span></a><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：再來的是那復活的身體。下一課</span> <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i9a03ac51dc\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 3 課 一次獻上</span></a><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">：「一次被獻」與「第二次顯現」同在來 9:28。又見</span> <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 17 課 審判活人死人</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 18 課 身體復活</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 24 課 升天</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 44 課 新天新地</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 46 課 祂的國沒有窮盡</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span><span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">第 75 課 儆醒預備</span></span><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">資料：</span></strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">和合本、</span>ASV 1901<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">、</span>KJV 1769<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；</span>OpenGNT<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；</span>BHSA<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；七十士譯本</span> = ABP <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">的希臘文本（</span>Sixtine 1587<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">，經</span> Bos 1709<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；但以理書為狄奧多田譯本）</span><code></code><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">。</span></li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">書目：</span></strong>Deissmann, <em>Light from the Ancient East</em> (1910), on parousia; Hoekema, <em>The Bible and the Future</em> (1979); Clouse (ed.), <em>The Meaning of the Millennium: Four Views</em> (1977); Knight, <em>Millennial Fever and the End of the World</em> (1993), on Miller.</li>\n<li><strong><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">信經：</span></strong>ELLC, <em>Praying Together</em> (1988)<span lang=\"zh-Hant\">；《尼西亞信經》合一中譯本；西敏信條 33 章（大意）。</span> English translations of the Apostles' Creed and the Nicene Creed © 1988 English Language Liturgical Consultation (ELLC), and used by permission. www.englishtexts.org</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"tag-words-標籤詞\">Tag words <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">標籤詞</span> <a class=\"up\" href=\"#%E6%91%98%E8%A6%81-summary\" title=\"回到摘要 back to the summary\">↑</a></h2>\n<p>#t/second-coming <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">基督再來</span> second coming <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἔρχομαι</span></span> <span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">בּוֹא</span></span> · #t/parousia <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">降臨</span> coming <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">παρουσία</span></span> · #t/appearing <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">顯現</span> appearing <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἐπιφάνεια</span></span> · #t/day-of-the-lord <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">主的日子</span> the day of the Lord <span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">יֹום־יְהוָה</span></span> · #t/son-of-man <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">人子</span> Son of man <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">υἱὸς ἀνθρώπου</span></span> <span class=\"off\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">כְּבַר אֱנָשׁ</span></span> · #t/judgment <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">審判</span> judgment <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">κρίνειν τὴν οἰκουμένην ἐν δικαιοσύνῃ</span></span> · #t/kingdom <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">國度</span> kingdom <span class=\"off\"><span lang=\"grc\">βασιλεία</span></span> · #t/hope <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">盼望</span> hope <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#ibd4fbde8cb\"><span lang=\"grc\">ἐλπίς</span></a> <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#ibd4fbde8cb\"><span dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"he\">קָוָה</span></a> · #t/glory <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">榮耀</span> glory <a class=\"wl\" href=\"#i45a4481517\"><span lang=\"grc\">δόξα</span></a> · #t/resurrection <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">復活</span> resurrection · #t/lords-supper <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">主的晚餐</span> the Lord's supper · #t/bridegroom <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">新郎</span> bridegroom · #t/reward <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">賞賜</span> reward · #t/eschatology <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">末世</span> · #t/death-and-grief <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">死亡與哀傷</span> · #t/preaching <span lang=\"zh-Hant\">講道</span><br><em></em></p><details class=\"pn across\" open><summary>跨燈 <i lang=\"en\">Across the lamps</i></summary><p class=\"acr\" data-b=\"3\"></p></details>"}});
